      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Stepping aside to answer Elena's call, Viktor Petrovich hears her declare that she has decided not to depend on men either because it is humiliating, before hanging up on him. Stung and distracted, the Chef returns to the table as the wedding clients begin listing changes to the banquet menu.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Секундочку, это очень важно.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
