      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'One second, this is very important.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Ты почему звонки сбрасываешь?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why do you keep hanging up on my calls?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "А я не хочу.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Because I do not want to talk.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Поэтому перезваниваю.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That is why I am calling you back.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Я тоже решила от мужчин не зависеть.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have also decided not to depend on men anymore.'",
